## Character Map Verification

명령:

```powershell
.\scripts\cook_prismatiscape_clean_map.ps1 -Map /Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/Maps/M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification -BuildGame -SmokeLaunch -SmokeTimeoutSeconds 60
```

`-BuildGame`가 필요한 이유:

- Character pass에서 project runtime C++ parent에 BP-editable motion properties를 추가했다.
- game target을 빌드하지 않은 첫 smoke는 cooked BP와 staged exe class layout mismatch로 exit code `3`이 났다.
- `-BuildGame` 후 같은 map은 smoke exit code `0`으로 통과했다.

결과:

| 항목 | 값 |
| --- | --- |
| Game target build | `Succeeded` |
| BuildCookRun | `BUILD SUCCESSFUL` |
| Target map entries | `2` |
| Character deform BP | `2` |
| `UltraDynamicSky/Maps/DemoMap` | `0` |
| `UltraDynamicSky/Maps/DemoMaterials` | `0` |
| `PrismatiscapeStudy` | `6` |
| `_MCP_Temp` | `0` |
| `Prismatiscape ExampleCharacter` | `8` |
| `Prismatiscape_CloudNoise` | `3` |
| `YeetoMosquito` | `2` |
| `Prismatiscape plugin Demo entries` | `13` |
| Staged GameDefaultMap | `/Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/Maps/M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification.M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification` |
| Staged EditorStartupMap | `/Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/Maps/M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification.M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification` |
| Source GameDefaultMap | `/Game/UltraDynamicSky/Maps/DemoMap.DemoMap` |
| Smoke launch exit code | `0` |

Smoke log map proof:

```text
Browse: /Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/Maps/M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification?Name=Player
LoadMap: /Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/Maps/M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification?Name=Player
```

## Native Manager Opt-in Verification

명령:

```powershell
.\scripts\cook_prismatiscape_clean_map.ps1 -Map /Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/Maps/M_PrisStudy_CleanMaterialVerification -BuildGame -UseStudyNativeManager -SmokeLaunch -SmokeTimeoutSeconds 60
```

결과:

| 항목 | 값 |
| --- | --- |
| Game target build | `Succeeded` |
| BuildCookRun | `BUILD SUCCESSFUL` |
| Target map entries | `2` |
| `UltraDynamicSky/Maps/DemoMap` | `0` |
| `UltraDynamicSky/Maps/DemoMaterials` | `0` |
| `PrismatiscapeStudy` | `12` |
| `_MCP_Temp` | `0` |
| `Prismatiscape Manager BP` | `2` |
| `Prismatiscape NiagaraGridDrawer` | `2` |
| `Prismatiscape ExampleCharacter` | `0` |
| `Prismatiscape_CloudNoise` | `3` |
| `YeetoMosquito` | `0` |
| `Prismatiscape plugin Demo entries` | `3` |
| Staged GameDefaultMap | `/Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/Maps/M_PrisStudy_CleanMaterialVerification.M_PrisStudy_CleanMaterialVerification` |
| Source GameDefaultMap | `/Game/UltraDynamicSky/Maps/DemoMap.DemoMap` |
| Staged `PrismatiscapeManagerClass` | `/Script/MCPGameProject.PrismatiscapeStudyNativeManager` |
| Smoke launch exit code | `0` |

이 pass는 staged runnable build가 project-owned native manager class를 opt-in으로 받을 수 있음을 증명한다. Canvas spatial RT placeholder 적용 후에도 smoke exit code `0`을 유지했다. `Prismatiscape Manager BP`, `NiagaraGridDrawer`, `CloudNoise`가 아직 manifest에 남는 것은 plugin constructor hard-load와 Manager/Niagara dependency chain의 known boundary다.

## Remaining Scope

- This gate proves a runnable staged build can enter clean/segment/character Prismatiscape maps without cooking UDS DemoMap.
- This gate also proves `-UseStudyNativeManager` can patch only staged `DefaultGame.ini` and launch with the project-owned native manager class.
- It does not change editor startup defaults in source config.
- It does not add a source `DefaultGame.ini` manager override.
- It does not remove Prismatiscape plugin demo textures. `/Prismatiscape/Demo` remains unsafe to exclude because `Prismatiscape_NiagaraGridDrawer` references `Prismatiscape_CloudNoise`.
- A durable project default map change should be a separate policy decision.
- Demo dependency chain audit: `Docs/Analysis/Prismatiscape_DemoDependencyAudit.md`.
